Third-party notices for the pyosys wheel
========================================

The wheel contains Yosys and the components below, compiled into libyosys and
yosys-abc or installed under share/. A license that ships as a file of its own
is in the wheel's .dist-info/licenses/ directory, at the path it has in the
Yosys source tree. The other license texts and notices follow the list.


